//
// Icon Reference (LVGL built-in symbols):
//   \uF015 = Home       \uF013 = Settings    \uF043 = Tint/Temp
//   \uF077 = Up         \uF078 = Down        \uF053 = Left
//   \uF054 = Right      \uF04B = Play        \uF04C = Pause
//   \uF04D = Stop       \uF1EB = WiFi        \uF008 = Camera
//   \uF00C = OK/Check   \uF00D = Close       \uF0E7 = Charge
//   \uF06E = Eye Open   \uF074 = Shuffle     \uF011 = Power
//   \uF55A = Backspace  \uF8A2 = New Line
//
// Font sizes used: 12 (tiny), 16 (body), 24 (icons), 32 (values)
// State suffixes: (none)=default, 10=checked, 20=pressed, 30=checked+pressed
// ================================================================


